<title>SPAIN: Spain Jan currency reserves rose $3.462 bln.</title>
<headline>Spain Jan currency reserves rose $3.462 bln.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following provisional figures (millions of dollars):</p>
<p> RESERVES		     JAN 97	DEC 96     JAN 96</p>
<p> Rise/fall in month	3,462.2     1,641.8     1,206.6</p>
<p> End-month total	  65,290.6    61,828.4    39,439.7</p>
</text>
